        G_{N-1}`, each with shape :math:`(S_0, ..., S_{N-1})` where
        the output :math:`G_i` is constructed by expanding :math:`T_i`
        to the result shape.

        .. note::
            0D inputs are treated equivalently to 1D inputs of a
            single element.

